    title: "Iran's navy says three oil tankers caught fire east of Hormuz",
    summary: "Iran's navy says three oil tankers caught fire east of Hormuz The Iranian navy said on Wednesday that three oil tankers caught fire and were disabled after hitting naval mines while sailing east of the Strait of Hormuz, according to Iran's Press TV. In a statement carried by the IRIB news agency, Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) said the tankers had ignored warnings from its naval forces as they navigated in restricted areas with navigation systems disabled and passage through the waterway must be coordinated with Iranian authorities.",
