    body: "UN committee adopts draft resolutions on Palestinian aid, property rights and Israeli occupation The United Nations General Assembly's Fourth Committee adopted on Wednesday three draft resolutions concerning support for the mandate and operations of the UN Agency for Palestinian refugees (UNRWA), the rights of Palestinian refugees to their properties, and the reaffirmation of the illegality of Israeli occupation of Palestinian territory, including East Jerusalem and the Syrian Golan.\n\nThe move was welcomed by Palestine's Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Expatriates, according to Wafa news agency, which called on the international community to honour its obligations to international law and UN resolutions to protect the rights of the Palestinian people.",
