    title: "Israeli forces say ground operation in Gaza to dismantle Hamas tunnels",
    summary: "Israeli forces say ground operation in Gaza to dismantle Hamas tunnels Israeli forces said on Wednesday that they launched a new military operation in Gaza to dismantle a tunnel west of the \"Yellow Line\". The Israeli military said in a statement that the army and the internal security agency Shin Bet launched the joint operation to \"dismantle a terror tunnel west of the Yellow Line that posed an immediate and direct threat to IDF troops\". The Yellow Line separates the Palestinian and Israeli-controlled areas in Gaza, with the Israeli army saying it controls more than 60 percent of the strip, and intends to continue its occupation indefinitely. A Gaza security source told AFP there was \"intense Israeli artillery shelling\" north of Nuseirat refugee camp and reported Israeli military vehicles in central Gaza \"amid ongoing gunfire and airstrikes since midday\", as Israeli strikes across Gaza killed three people on Wednesday.",
